# Feature UI placement

- Feature UI stays in `src/features/<feature>/` as sibling files (Connect modal, Controller patch bar, later Editor/Library).
- `src/components/ui/` is shadcn primitives only. `src/components/` is shell chrome (`main-menu`, `theme-toggle`).
- Do **not** add `src/components/connection/` or other pedal/domain folders under `src/components/`.
- Promote a widget to `src/components/` only when a second feature imports it.

Extract when at least one is true: orchestrator plus two or more screens; the same JSX pasted twice; named inner functions already read as components and the parent is hard to navigate. Do not extract a lone button.

```text
# ❌ BAD
src/components/connection/ScanPanel.tsx

# ✅ GOOD
src/features/connect/ScanPanel.tsx
```
